{"unit_id":"nobu121__dsh-opencode-session#card-zh","repo":"nobu121/dsh-opencode-session","commit":"a7efa861d95e3506e8dda4e2e2b2b7f09d07b298","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-opencode-session 为 DSH 中的 OpenCode 和 OpenCode Go 流式模型请求添加 x-opencode-session。它监听 llm/stream，仅处理配置的 provider 且带 sessionId 的调用，并在 Node.js 全局 fetch 请求中注入请求头；已有同名请求头会保留。默认复用稳定的 DSH 会话 ID，也可选每会话 UUID。插件可配置路由和调试日志，卸载时恢复 fetch。适合需要为 OpenCode 请求保持会话标识的用户，无需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:147-207","cordis.patch.yml:10-18"]}
{"unit_id":"nobu121__dsh-opencode-session#card-en","repo":"nobu121/dsh-opencode-session","commit":"a7efa861d95e3506e8dda4e2e2b2b7f09d07b298","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-opencode-session adds x-opencode-session to matching OpenCode streams in DSH. It uses Node's global fetch, preserves existing values, and supports a session ID or per-session UUID. Configure provider routes and debug logs; restart the profile after installation. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:147-207","cordis.patch.yml:10-18"]}
